WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
Yes Li Wei, we are all you

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:16,470
Next, listen to me. He is a great man. Kill him. What great man? Great man?

3
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,270
Li Wei is a great man

4
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:21,230
Li Yang How could I be a great man?

5
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,710
I just had a little quarrel with you yesterday and you regarded me as a great man.

6
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:25,110
Li Wei, stop pretending

7
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:26,230
you are a great man

8
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:28,070
I am a great man

9
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,540
You set the rules about not killing indiscriminately.

10
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,300
Now because of a little conflict

11
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,300
You just want to kill people, right?

12
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,100
Li Wei just shared some of the food with me.

13
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:38,940
How could he be a great man?

14
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:43,860
Brother Lin said you are a great man. You must be a great man. Stop pretending.

15
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:45,340
How do you prove that I am a great man?

16
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:46,930
Still say

17
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:49,490
You are from the Yuyan family, right?

18
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:51,610
How do you prove that he is a great man?

19
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:53,250
I'm not from the Yuyan family

20
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:58,410
But I have evidence, evidence, evidence, evidence

21
00:00:58,610 --> 00:01:00,330
There is blood on his hands
